{"id":128,"date":"2016-05-16T13:01:12","date_gmt":"2016-05-16T13:01:12","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/masterbadminton.dev\/definition-of-backhand-and-learning-about-backhand\/"},"modified":"2016-09-01T08:27:47","modified_gmt":"2016-09-01T08:27:47","slug":"definition-of-backhand-and-learning-about-backhand-html","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/masterbadminton.com\/definition-of-backhand-and-learning-about-backhand.html","title":{"rendered":"Definition of Backhand and Learning About Backhand"},"content":{"rendered":"<div id=\"ContentColumn\">\n<div class=\"Liner\">\n<style type=\"text\/css\"><![CDATA[.errFld{padding:3px}.errFldOn{padding:0px;border:3px solid red}.errMsg{font-weight:bold;color:red;visibility:hidden}.errMsgOn{visibility:visible}#edit textarea{border:1px solid #000}.editTitle{font-size:22px;font-weight:bold;text-align:center}#preview .editTitle{margin-top:0px}.editName,.editCountry{text-align:center}.editName,.editCountry,.editBody{}.editBody{text-align:left}#preview{margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto}.GadSense{float:left;vertical-align:top;padding:0 8px 8px 0;margin:0 8px 0px 0}.gLinkUnitTop{width:466px;margin:12px auto}.gLinkUnitBot{width:120px;float:right;margin:4px 0 24px 36px}]]><\/style>\n<div id=\"submission_26568605\" style=\"border:0px solid black;padding:5px;\">\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<p>        by Sidney<\/p>\n<p>(Wass)<\/p>\n<p>\n        <strong>Sidney&#8217;s question:<\/strong> &#8220;<em>Definition of backhand? I want to learn about backhand!&#8221;<\/em><\/p>\n<p>Hi Sidney,<\/p>\n<p>The definition for a backhand means hitting the shuttle with your racket WHILE the back of your hand is facing the shuttle. <\/p>\n<p>This is a very unique shot in any racket sports. <br \/>The technique to perform the badminton backhand is very different from tennis or squash. In badminton, the backhand stroke can be used to perform powerful shots such as the <a href=\"badminton-backhand-smash.html\">backhand smash<\/a>. <\/p>\n<p>Besides, one can bring the backhand smash to a more advanced level, by performing the jumping backhand smash. <\/p>\n<p>Here&#8217;s a video showing an example of a jumping backhand smash performed by world class player, Taufik Hidayat (Jumping backhand smash performed at 0:12-0:14)<\/p>\n<p><iframe loading=\"lazy\" width=\"420\" height=\"345\" src=\"http:\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/CzZKq17ydJI\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"\"><\/iframe><\/p>\n<p>This kind of backhand shots can never be seen in any other racket sports. <\/p>\n<h3>More About The Backhand Technique<\/h3>\n<p>In order to execute powerful shots, a player must be familiar with the basic backhand stroke. <\/p>\n<p>It&#8217;s important to learn how to generate maximum power in your basic backhand stroke. <\/p>\n<p>Basically to get the correct badminton backhand technique, you must<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Switch to the badminton backhand grip.<\/strong> In badminton, the <a href=\"badminton-gripping-technique.html#backhand\">backhand gripping technique<\/a> is used for backhand strokes. The way you hold your badminton racket determines how much strength you are able to transfer into your badminton shots. Therefore, hold your racket correctly.\n<p><a href=\"badminton-gripping-technique.html#backhand\">Learn more about the badminton backhand grip <strong>here<\/strong><\/a>.<\/li>\n<li><strong>Perform correct badminton backhand stroke technique.<\/strong> Next, you must have a good backhand swing motion (referred to as the backhand stroke).\n<p>While performing your backhand stroke, make a complete swing to generate more momentum. The objective is to transfer this momentum into the shuttle as your racket make contact with the shuttle. <\/li>\n<p><a href=\"badminton-backhand.html\">This page offers you the practical steps to perform a basic badminton backhand stroke<\/a>.<\/ul>\n<p>The backhand shots are extremely useful in badminton games. It is not easy to learn but once you get the technique right, you&#8217;re on your way to do fancy backhands in badminton. <\/p>\n<p>Of course, the backhand shot in the video i showed you above is a badminton skill performed by a world class player. Do not put high hopes in performing that kind of backhand shots without LOTS of practice. <\/p>\n<p>Once you are familiar with performing the basic backhand stroke, learn how to <strong>hit various backhand shots such as<\/strong>:<\/p>\n<p><a href=\"badminton-backhand-drop.html\">Badminton Backhand Drop<\/a> <\/p>\n<p><a href=\"badminton-backhand-smash.html\">Badminton backhand Smash<\/a> <\/p>\n<p><a href=\"badminton-backhand-clear.html\">Badminton Backhand Clear<\/a> <\/p><\/div>\n<p>\n\t <a href=\"definition-of-backhand-and-learning-about-backhand-comment-form.html\" class=\"old-comments\">Click here to post comments<\/a>\n         <\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left;\">\n          <a href=\"badminton-techniques-questions.html#INV\" class=\"noplsin\"><br \/>\n              Join in and write your own page! It&#8217;s easy to do. How? Simply click here to return to <b>Questions on Skills and Shots<\/b>.<\/a>\n          <\/p>\n<h3 class=\"fblikeste\">Like Masterbadminton.com?<\/h3>\n<p\/>\n<div id=\"fb-root\"\/><script><![CDATA[(function(d,s,id){var js,fjs=d.getElementsByTagName(s)[0];if(d.getElementById(id)){return;}js=d.createElement(s);js.id=id;js.src=\"..\/connect.facebook.net\/en_US\/all.js#xfbml=1\";fjs.parentNode.insertBefore(js,fjs);}(document,'script','facebook-jssdk'));]]><\/script><like href=\"index.html\" send=\"false\" width=\"450\" show_faces=\"false\"\/>\n<div align=\"left\">\n<like-box href=\"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/pages\/How-To-Play-Badminton\/365607500122681\" width=\"400\" height=\"300\" show_faces=\"false\" stream=\"true\" header=\"true\"\/>\n<\/div><\/div><\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>by Sidney (Wass) Sidney&#8217;s question: &#8220;Definition of backhand? I want to learn about backhand!&#8221; Hi Sidney, The definition for a bac